{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2021-10-20 13:14:00', 'title': "BALL CORPORATION TO ADVANCE GLOBAL SUSTAINABILITY EFFORTS WITH DEVELOPMENT OF BRAZIL'S FIRST CIRCULAR ECONOMY LAB", 'text': "WESTMINSTER, COLO., OCT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BALL CORPORATION (NYSE: BLL) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO CREATE BRAZIL'S FIRST CIRCULAR ECONOMY LAB IN FERNANDO DE NORONHA , ONE OF THE COUNTRY'S MOST POPULAR TOURIST DESTINATIONS AND A LEADER ON SUSTAINABLE TOURISM."}